{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picture the day you finally sell this\nhouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The offer comes in. It is far more than\nyou paid all those years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7280,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And your first thought is the fear every\nolder seller carries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12020,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much of this will the tax man take."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16000,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have watched the house grow in value\nfor decades, and somewhere along the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21300,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way that good news started to feel like a\nbill you would owe one day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24960,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is what almost no one will tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27720,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For most people your age, the answer is\nnothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31280,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a smaller share, not a lower rate,\nnothing at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36240,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a rule with your name on it that\nlets you keep money the tax office"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41060,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not allowed to reach. And that is only\nthe first thing you are quietly owed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46380,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a home owner this year. There are five\nof these breaks, and I am going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51500,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "give them to you plainly, in order, from\nthe largest to the smallest, so you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56440,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can act on the ones that fit your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58720,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one of them needs a lawyer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60840,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most need nothing more than a single phone\ncall and the willingness to ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65900,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stay with me, because the first one alone\ncould be worth more than everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71200,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "else you own. So let me start with the big\none, because it is the one that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75240,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "frightens people the most and costs them\nthe most when they get it wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78740,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you sell the home you have lived in,\nthe government lets you keep an enormous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82420,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "share of the gain with no tax at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84900,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a single person, that shield covers up\nto two hundred fifty thousand dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89100,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of profit, and for a married couple, it\ncovers up to five hundred thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93920,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollars. Read those numbers again slowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97480,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is profit, not the sale price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101220,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So picture this, a home you bought long\nago for very little, sold today for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106580,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far more, that can hand you hundreds of\nthousands of dollars the tax office"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111320,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply cannot touch. Now let me make sure\nyou understand what the word profit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116160,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really means here, because this is where\npeople scare themselves for no reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120260,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your profit is not the price on the sign."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122760,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the sale price, minus what you paid\nfor the home in the first place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127240,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "minus every dollar you ever put into\nimproving it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130080,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The new roof. The kitchen you redid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132440,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bathroom you made safe with the grab\nbars and the walk in shower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135620,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The deck, the furnace, the new windows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138800,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every one of those raises the number the\ntax office counts as your cost, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143880,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means it lowers your profit. Most people\nnever kept those receipts, and never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148660,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knew they mattered. So even a home that\nhas climbed high in value often shows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154560,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a far smaller profit than the owner fears,\nand that profit usually sits well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160820,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under the shield. The one rule that\nmatters is a plain one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165340,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have owned the home and lived in\nit as your main home for two of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171340,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last five years, and that is it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174420,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most older people meet that with ease, and\nnever knew this shield was theirs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179620,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is a piece of this that almost no\none ever explains to a widow, though"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185080,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it may be the most important thing in this\nwhole video for her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188540,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When a husband or a wife passes away,\nsomething quiet and powerful happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193840,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the value of the home in the eyes of\nthe tax office."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196540,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The home is treated, at least in part, as\nif it were bought fresh on the day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202140,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that spouse died, at whatever it was worth\non that day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205680,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They call it a step up. What it means in\nplain words is this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210520,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the growth in value that built up over\nall those years of marriage can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214200,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be wiped clean off the books. So a widow\nwho sells the home a year or two after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219600,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "losing her husband often owes little or\nnothing, even on a house that grew"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223840,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by hundreds of thousands of dollars over a\nlifetime together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228400,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have lost your spouse, and you have\nbeen afraid to sell because of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232440,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax, please hear me. Sit down with someone\nwho knows these rules before you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237800,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assume you owe a single dollar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239800,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer may bring you to tears of\nrelief."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242640,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the last part of this one, the\npart worth staying for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247340,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a bill moving through Congress\nright now that would lift that main"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252580,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shield all the way to one million dollars\nfor people over sixty five who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258720,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have owned their home for many years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261320,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not law yet. I will not tell you it\nis, because that would be a lie,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266840,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are enough of those going\naround."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269480,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it tells you which way the wind is\nblowing, and it is blowing in your favor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275480,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me make this real for a moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277450,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of a widow who bought her home with\nher husband many years ago for a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281260,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "modest sum. He is gone now. The house has\ngrown in value far beyond what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287540,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they ever imagined. She wants to sell, and\nmove closer to her children, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293260,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "she is terrified of the tax. She has put\nit off for years over that one fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298860,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She has stayed in a house that is too big\nand too empty, climbing stairs she"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304240,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should not be climbing, all because of a\ntax she was sure would eat her savings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309340,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then she learns the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311700,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Between the shield and the step up, on a\ngain of that size, she owes nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318120,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a penny. The fear that kept her stuck\nwas never real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322740,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is how much these rules can change a\nlife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325820,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So do not let that be your story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328680,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second one is happening this very\nmonth, and it is one you have to reach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334320,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out and claim, because no one will hand it\nto you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339340,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Across the country, the breaks on the\nyearly tax you pay on the home itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343780,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just grew larger for older owners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347740,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One large state lifted the share of the\nhome value that seniors can shield"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352660,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from that tax, from about a half to nearly\ntwo thirds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356520,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another added a fresh sixty thousand\ndollars of protected value on top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362760,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what older owners already had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364880,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one state is sending a property tax\npayment straight to older home owners"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369820,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in two parts this year, and the first part\nis going out this very month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374980,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now here is the trap, and it is the reason\nso many people leave this money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379120,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the table. Almost all of these ask you\nto apply again, or to apply for the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384500,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very first time, before the new and larger\namount is yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388680,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The county does not go looking for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391400,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not mail you a note that says you\nare owed more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394620,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money is sitting there, and it does\nnot move until you ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398760,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on top of these exemptions, most\nplaces also have what they call a freeze,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403360,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where once you reach a certain age your\nhome value is locked in for tax purposes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408680,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so your bill stops climbing even as the\nhome keeps rising around you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413520,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the lesson is simple. Call your county\ntax office, or walk in, and ask three"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418920,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plain questions. What is the senior amount\nthis year, am I getting all of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423420,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can my home value be frozen at my age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427160,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bring your identification and a paper that\nproves your age, and let them walk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you through the rest. The third is for\nanyone who looks at that yearly tax"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436400,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the home and still feels the squeeze\neven after the exemptions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441440,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In most states there is a quiet program\nthat lets an older owner simply stop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446680,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "paying that property tax now, and let it\nwait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450400,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not lose the home, you are not\npunished, you are not doing anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455160,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wrong. The unpaid tax rests gently against\nthe house at a very low cost, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461160,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is only settled far later, when the\nhome is one day sold or passed on to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466220,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your family. For a person living on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468440,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a fixed check, that can mean keeping\nhundreds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471440,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of dollars in your pocket every single\nmonth that used to leave it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475600,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about that, money you needed anyway,\nstaying home with you, month after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481360,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "month. Now I want to be honest with you,\nbecause this one is not for everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485060,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your dream is to hand the home to your\nchildren completely free and clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488860,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with nothing owed against it, then this\nmay not be your path, because the tax"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493780,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that waited does get paid back out of the\nhome in the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496540,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for the person who is what they call\nhouse rich and cash poor, sitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501040,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside a home worth plenty while counting\nevery dollar of a small check, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505560,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be a quiet blessing. It is the\ndifference between a tight month and an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509880,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "easy one, between choosing your medicine\nor your heat and choosing neither"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514940,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fear at all. And almost no one is ever\ntold the program is even there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519560,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to ask for it by name, so say the\nwords property tax deferral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525620,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for seniors, and watch them reach for the\nform they almost never hand out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531100,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth one is money that quietly leaks\nout of the pocket of anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537540,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who still carries a mortgage on the home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540200,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you first bought, if you put down\nless than a fifth of the price, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546340,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lender most likely added a monthly charge\ncalled private mortgage insurance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552760,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a fee that protects the lender, not\nyou, in case you ever stopped paying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559620,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is what so many people never\nlearn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563760,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The moment you have paid the loan down to\nwhere you own a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569840,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fifth of the home outright, you have the\nright to ask them to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576000,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "remove that charge for good. Once you own\na little more than that, they are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581960,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "required by law to drop it on their own,\nwhether you ask or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586780,
    "dDurationMs": 6100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But many quietly let it run for years and\nyears, collecting that fee every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592880,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "month, simply because you never spoke up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595740,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So pull out your latest mortgage\nstatement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597660,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look down the list for that line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599420,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you see it, and you have been paying on\nthis home for a good many years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603660,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a very good chance you crossed\nthat mark long ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607720,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One written letter to your lender asking\nthem to remove it can end it for good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613220,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They may send someone to confirm what the\nhome is worth, and that is normal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617700,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so do not let it stop you. Because this is\nnot a gift you have to beg for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623760,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a right the law already handed you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626540,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You simply have to use it. And the last\none is small, but it is the kind of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632060,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing that makes you smile, because it is\nso easy and so overlooked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637000,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In many states, once you reach a certain\nage, the yearly fee to register your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642360,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "car drops. In a few places it falls away\nentirely for one vehicle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647520,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you are a veteran, or you carry a\ndisability, the break is often larger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652880,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still, sometimes covering the plates and\nthe fees completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658860,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not a fortune, but it is yours, year\nafter year, for the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665040,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rest of your life, for the price of one\nshort call or one short visit to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669800,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "motor vehicle office. Ask them the plain\nquestion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672780,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there a lower rate for my age, and is\nthere one for veterans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677400,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is one more quiet sign of the same\ntruth running through all of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682840,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a whole set of these breaks built\nfor you, sitting there and waiting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687860,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the only reason you ever pay full\nprice is that no one ever told you to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693100,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ask. Before you go, one last thing worth\nholding onto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697720,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That break on your home sale, the very\nfirst one we talked about, may soon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703040,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grow even larger for people over sixty\nfive, if that bill now sitting in Congress"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708520,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "becomes law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710460,
    "dDurationMs": 6460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the smart move is simple, learn what\nyou are owed today, claim the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716920,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ones that fit your life, and keep an eye\non what comes next, because the door"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722040,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is only opening wider. You spent a\nlifetime paying into all of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727060,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no shame, and no trouble, in\nfinally taking back what was set aside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731800,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for you. If someone you love owns a home\nand has been carrying these costs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736120,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "alone, quietly paying full price for want\nof one phone call, pass this along"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741800,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to them. It may be the very thing that\nlets them keep far more of what they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746440,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worked a whole lifetime to build."
    } ]
  } ]
}
